# ============================================================
# IMPORTANT PROJECT FILES RETAINED BY GIT
#
# These are intentionally not ignored:
#
# app.py
# camera_worker.py
# settings.json
# requirements.txt
# README.md
# models/
# static/
# templates/
# tests/
# tools/
# legacy/
#
# Both the original PT model and the OpenVINO deployment model
# remain available for installation and deployment.
# ============================================================